### 2. PROJECT IDENTITY

Project name: SortAI

Project category: Artificial intelligence, computer vision, electronic waste management, recycling logistics, and B2B marketplace.

Primary users:
1. Informal scrap collectors and kabadiwalas.
2. Scrap shop owners and collection centres.
